jamal walker is a normal guy working a  full-time job at a theme park called  medieval world the owner of the park is  worried about its future because it is  suffering financially in addition a  competitor theme park called the castle  world is opening right next to them if  they do not come up with new ideas the  medieval world is bound to go bankrupt  one afternoon jamal is tasked to clean  the ditch surrounding the park while he  is at it he notices a medallion in the  water which looks like it could be worth  a lot of money probably 35 from the gift  shop while trying to retrieve it jamal  falls into the ditch and although it is  pretty shallow he drowns when he comes  out of the water he sees that he is no  longer in the park he rationalizes that  this must be in castle world which is  near to their park what jamal doesn't  know is that he has been sucked into the  past into 1300s england the first person  he meets is a drunkard named nolte  although he is clearly wearing ancient  clothes jamal thinks he is a worker in  costume ignoring the man he makes his  way into the city and comes across a  massive castle which to him is the main  attraction of castle world he tries to  go inside but is stopped by the guards  they ask him where he is from to which  he replies normandy jamal means normandy  from la but the guards assume that he is  a french moor who they had been  expecting to come next week they let him  in and jamal is introduced to a bustling  market where everyone is wearing  clothing from the 1300s he's impressed  by the accuracy of the theme park still  unaware that he has traveled through  time suddenly his eyes land on a  beautiful girl named victoria jamal  approaches her to shoot his shot but  they are interrupted by the cruel  commander general percival he acts like  he owns all the women in the town just  because he is a royal guard hence his  ego is hurt when he gets a bit too close  to victoria and jamal stops him he  threatens to complain to the manager  about the misconduct percival pulls out  his sword on him but jamal thinks it is  fake and surprises everyone with his  bravery following that he meets a  stranger who brings him to the king at  his request the king has arranged a  marriage between his daughter regina and  the duke of normandy he thinks jamal is  a messenger and inquires when the duke  is going to be here a confused jamal  plays along and randomly names a date  later that day he is taken outside to  witness an execution he is excited  thinking that they are just actors  playing along with the theme the  execution goes smoothly but when jamal  picks up the decapitated head of a rebel  his world  changes he is so in shock that he falls  unconscious without saying a word when  jamal wakes up he finds himself in his  room with victoria he is wearing the  medallion that he found in the ditch  which makes her believe he is one of her  people she shows him her medallion which  is similar to his turns out the  medallion is a symbol of the rebellions  who are tired of the king's cruel  judgment system he has dethroned the  former queen unfairly and has killed  many innocents for criticizing his rule  the group of rebels want to kick him out  of the kingdom and bring the former  queen back into power still confused  jamal asks her what date it is and finds  out it is  1328 a.d he freaks out and wants to  return to his own time but doesn't know  how they are then interrupted by a guard  who invites them for a horse riding  adventure because of jamal's lack of  knowledge about horses he amuses  everyone with his horse riding technique  even the king enjoys the show and then  invites him to a royal dinner that night  the party is dull so jamal lights it up  by dancing like he used to in the future  everyone joins him and it becomes the  most lively party the palace has ever  held in the middle of it princess regina  pulls jamal aside and forcefully plants  a kiss on his lips she has been hitting  on him ever since his arrival but was  too scared to approach him in front of  her father percival catches him  red-handed and is enraged by the  audacity of the newcomer at the same  time two rebels are seconds away from  attacking the king jamal hangs by the  chandelier and lands on the king  ironically saving him from the rebels  when the situation calms down percival  is reprimanded for not doing his job  properly while jamal is praised and made  the head of security percival drowns in  jealousy and anger but he's bound to  keep his head down in front of the  king's decision being the head of  security jamal is given a bunch of  responsibilities he puts forward his  idea to rebuild the opening to the  castle with his head which he argues  will keep the enemies away before the  plan is implemented the king calls him  for a more important task a farmer was  found stealing a turnip from the royal  garden even though it was to feed his  starving family he is ordered to be  executed for his crime moreover since  jamal is the security head he is the one  that has to take care of the execution  when the king leaves he lets the poor  farmer go and even gives him some money  for food at night jamal asks to be  presented with the finest chambermaid  for his entertainment he chooses  victoria and gets her alone in his room  with the excuse of sleeping with her  victoria still wants him to be an asset  to the rebel group and help them  assassinate the king however after  seeing that the king kills people over  vegetables jamal is no longer interested  in rebelling victoria is disappointed  but he argues that he is just not the  man for the job she calls him a coward  and leaves at midnight a woman comes  into jamal's room and makes love to him  he thinks it is victoria and doesn't  protest the next morning the real  messenger from normandy arrives and the  king finds out jamal has been lying to  them he the messenger and the guards  barge into jamal's room and find him  naked with princess regina by his side  percival accuses him of forcefully  deflowering the princess jamal argues  that someone had already got to the  princess's flower before him but no one  listens the messenger calls off the  wedding because regina is no longer fit  to be a duchess as a result of the chaos  jamal is thrown into the dungeon and  arraigned for execution with the two  rebels who attempted to assassinate the  king in the dungeon jamal makes friends  with the rebels who have already  accepted their death they tell him the  story of the black knight a  revolutionary warrior it is believed  that the knight could not be bribed with  all the money in the world and would  fight vigorously for justice in one of  the battles he was swallowed whole by a  dragon however with the help of a sword  of gold he cut himself from the belly  and killed the beast after the incident  he could even breathe fire like a dragon  itself the next day the trio is brought  in front of the crowd to be executed in  a moment of panic jamal tells people  that he is a wizard from the future who  has the power to burn everyone he tries  to prove his point by using a lighter  but it doesn't work when he is seconds  away from being beheaded the executioner  begins to choke on an apple this makes  the crowd believe he has cast a spell of  death upon him jamal goes with the  misconception and pretends to do the  same on the crowd suddenly a fire breaks  nearby proving his power to the  commoners but in reality the rebels are  firing flaming arrows from outside the  castle to save their people in the end  jamal and the others escape the castle  with victoria's help jamal also meets  the drunkard named nolte on horseback  and finds out he used to be the knight  of the former queen he was one of the  greatest warriors of the kingdom before  the king dethroned the queen and kicked  him out as well he eventually turned  into an alcoholic but somewhere inside  everyone knows that the fighter in him  is still alive after spending some time  with the rebellious group jamal realizes  the severity of the situation and  decides to help them dethrone the king  at last while in the woods he notices  three men troubling nolte for no reason  he helps the guy but is caught by the  thugs himself nolte comes out of his  shell and fights the bullies to free  jamal he is now motivated to quit  drinking and help the group in their  purpose the two then return to the  settlement and find it in shambles it  turns out percival and his troops have  destroyed it and abducted victoria  everyone loses hope of ever winning this  fight when the former queen reveals  herself she discloses she was with them  all this time helping them from the  shadows for the next few days the group  prepares to plan a better attack jamal  who has the knowledge of the future  teaches them tactics used in american  football and pro wrestling this gives  the unarmed rebels a means to battle  when the time comes he himself learns  some basic sword fighting techniques  from nolte then the day of the attack  finally comes the group prepares itself  and gets ready to fight with their lives  nolte leads them to the castle but in  only a few minutes they are completely  surrounded by guards under percival's  order they are outnumbered and pushed  back then to everyone's surprise the  battlefield is invaded by the black  knight himself he makes a grand entrance  urging the guards to run away from him  not only that but he also breathes fire  out of his mouth the rebels finally  think they are about to win but that is  until the black knight falls off his  horse revealing that he is none other  than jamal himself percival is about to  end his life when nolte comes to his  rescue and fights the guard following  that a fierce battle ensues between the  two parties using the techniques that  jamal taught them the commoners are able  to trick and defeat many guards amidst  the battle the king runs to percival and  begs him to bring him to safety percival  sees him as a weak and unworthy leader  hence when the king tries to give him an  order he in turn orders him to shut up  and pushes him off the castle into the  mode the fight seems to be shifting to  the side of the rebels until percival  shoots a longbow at nolte and hurts him  gravely after that he takes victoria  hostage jamal bolts to her rescue and  uses the technique taught by nolte to  fight percival is surprised and tries  his best to stay his ground but in the  end jamal wins and manages to rescue  victoria as he is picking her up  percival stands up again getting ready  to kill jamal once and for all however  he is shot dead by nolte who is still  alive on the battlefield in the end the  rebels become the victors and jamal  turns into everyone's hero a few weeks  later it is time for him to return home  he wishes victoria goodbye and leaves  her with one last kiss before departing  the queen awards him as the black knight  of the kingdom flattering  racist but flattering a while later  jamal wakes back up in the 2000s  surrounded by a paramedic and his  colleagues from the theme park they  disclosed that he drowned in the ditch  and was saved but has been unconscious  ever since the rational way to describe  his experience would be to call it a  dream but jamal knows it wasn't that  before he went into the past he wanted  to leave his job to transfer to the  castle themed park where he could make  more money but now his attitude has  changed because he knows almost  everything about the medieval world he  offers his ideas to the owner and makes  the theme park more on theme that's the  corporate attitude jamal it becomes a  huge success that overshadows the castle  world's opening six weeks later jamal is  taking a stroll in the park when he  comes across a woman named nicole who  looks exactly like victoria nicole  comments that he looks familiar and the  two start a conversation they feel the  sparks between them but nicole has to  leave because of her nephew suddenly  jamal remembers to ask for her number  and runs behind her but while trying to  catch up he falls into the ditch again  this time he wakes up in the coliseum of  ancient rome about to be devoured by  lions unfortunately this movie got  slammed by critics and it never got a  sequel so  jamal probably died subscribe for more  videos like this turn on notifications  and leave a like to help the channel out  thank you for watching
 

